      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "all mouse actions:\n\nright/left click\nscroll up/down\nscroll left/right\nback/forward buttons\ncursor\n\nspeech to text\n\nzoom in/out\nincrease/decrease volume\nincrease/decrease brightness\n\nscreenshot\nsleep mode\n\ndrag/drop\nswitch tabs\n\n\n====================\ninputs:\nhand (some features don't care about left or right)\nhead\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "all mouse actions:\n\nright/left click\nscroll up/down\nscroll left/right\nback/forward buttons\ncursor\n\nspeech to text\n\nzoom in/out\nincrease/decrease volume\nincrease/decrease brightness\n\nscreenshot\nsleep mode\n\ndrag/drop\nswitch tabs\n\n\n====================\ninputs:\nhand (some features don't care about left or right)\nhead\n",
